        <briefdescription>
<para>Generate a view from a measurement. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The view is processed from a measurement by the viewer. The resulting view handle can be accessed by the <ref refid="group__cuvis__viewer_1ga8bc5efb8826289c447dfa49c167ed133" kindref="member">cuvis_view_get_data_count</ref> to get number of elements, <ref refid="group__cuvis__viewer_1ga61f38b6fef05af6f48686b857fafcc19" kindref="member">cuvis_view_get_data</ref> to get a single date element and <ref refid="group__cuvis__viewer_1ga2f458a19c7fcc4000b3890ff7f1b2558" kindref="member">cuvis_view_free</ref> to release the view (this must always be called)</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">i_viewer</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The viewer </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">i_mesu</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>the measurement </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="out">o_pView</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>the resulting view handle. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><ref refid="group__cuvis__returns_1ggaa06c62ba25240f4763da0e590ebf3b9dad52787b0cfb0da2c053a68bcdc54bc6f" kindref="member">status_ok</ref> if the measurement was processed successfully. </para>
